Started as an internal [[2on2]] tournament within the [[portuguese]] quakeworld community to make even teams with a div1-2 and a div4-3 players on each team. Because some players were unable to participate, a few friends that usually play with them were invited to replace.

==Format==
* Map pool: [[dm2]], [[dm4]], [[dm6]], [[aerowalk]], [[ztndm3]].
* Each team plays same opponent TWICE.
* Quake friends get together for some fun and frags.
* Teamoverlay OFF
* Spectators OFF
* Powerups ON (except dm4)
* Victory = 30 points
* Loss = 10 points
* In the end, if two teams have the same points, then:
'''1)''' the games between them prevails.
<br />
'''2)''' if the two games between those teams was a win each, then the team with less map losses will prevail.
<br />
'''3)''' if both teams have the same number of maps lost, then a new game must happen to decide each team position.

